.SH "نام (NAME)"
kmouth \- A type\-and\-say front end for speech synthesizers
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBkmouth\fR\ 'u
\fBkmouth\fR [\fIfilename\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
KMouth
is an application that enables persons that cannot speak to let their computers speak\&. It includes a history of spoken sentences from which the user can select sentences to be re\-spoken\&.
.PP
Note that
KMouth
does not include speech synthesizer\&. Instead it requires a speech synthesizer installed in the system\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB\fIfilename\fR\fR
.RS 4
The history file to open\&.
.RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
espeak(1), festival(1), mbrola(1), freetts(1)
.PP
More detailed user documentation is available from
\m[blue]\fBhelp:/kmouth\fR\m[]
(either enter this
URL
into
Konqueror, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB \fR\fB\fIhelp:/kmouth\fR\fR)\&.
.PP
There is also further information available at the
\m[blue]\fBKDE Accessibility project web site\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[1]\d\s+2\&.
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
KMouth
was written by
Gunnar Schmi Dt
<kmouth@schmi\-dt\&.de>\&.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBLauri Watts\fR <\&lauri@kde\&.org\&>
.RS 4
KMouth man page\&.
.RE
